  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f2wMZKZ7B6E\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/735938861636780042?style=flat-square&amp;logo=discord&amp;label=Discord&amp;color=5865F2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> • <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcozary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support-Ko--fi-F16061?style=flat-square&amp;logo=ko-fi&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a> • <a href=\"https://github.com/Cozary/Ore-Creeper/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Cozary/Ore-Creeper?style=flat-square&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white&amp;color=364763\" alt=\"Issues\"></a> • <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fore-creeper\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://badges.crowdin.net/ore-creeper/localized.svg\" alt=\"Crowdin\"></a></p><h2><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Tt26lbp.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></h2><h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>關於</strong></span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>這個模組加入了以遊戲中各種礦石為基礎的苦力怕。當你探索時，你會發現它們，而當它們爆炸時，周圍的方塊會根據苦力怕的類型轉變為礦石！礦石TNT能將普通苦力怕轉變為礦石苦力怕！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>苦力怕不會造成任何傷害，但如果你想擊殺它們，它們也會掉落一些戰利品。有一個設定檔可以讓你調整生成速率以及爆炸範圍。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media4.giphy.com/media/3c3AeAgjwUrxxHHMvC/giphy.gif?cid=790b761105b1f854bcf1755223d062ae19da9783192e511a&amp;rid=giphy.gif&amp;ct=g\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h2><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Tt26lbp.png\" alt=\"\"></h2><h2><strong>生成修改資料包</strong></h2><p>若要在 NeoForge 和 Forge 中修改礦石苦力怕的生成速率，你必須透過修改並使用以下 <a href=\"https://github.com/Cozary/Ore-Creeper/tree/1.21/datapacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">資料包</a> 來達成。</p><h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>資源包相容性</strong></span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/squishys-reanimated-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/title/squishys-reanimated-mobs.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
